{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aegis/1514796-trinity-aegis-kickstarter","id":1514796,"title":"[Trinity] Aegis Kickstarter!","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","The Trinity Continuum","Trinity Continuum: Aegis"],"posts":[{"date":"2023-06-12T21:49:06-07:00","id":1514796,"title":"[Trinity] Aegis Kickstarter!","content":"From <b>this weeks Monday Meeting Notes</b> - <b>Aegis</b> coming as crowdfunding after They Came From RPG Anthology!<br /> Will it be a start of July?<br /> <br /> \u200b\u200b( Observation - OPP is doing 2-3 weeks break between their crowdfundings, They Came end on June 22nd. )<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://theonyxpath.com/convincing-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://theonyxpath.com/wp-content/uploads/2023/11/OPP-Metal.png\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://theonyxpath.com/convincing-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"> CONvincing! [Monday Meeting Notes] &ndash; Onyx Path Publishing </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://theonyxpath.com/convincing-monday-meeting-notes/\" target=\"_blank\"> https://theonyxpath.com/convincing-monday-meeting-notes/ </a> </div> <div class=\"meta\"> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":1437,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","user":"wyrdhamster","date":". 06-25-2023, 02:26 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-19T13:41:04-07:00","id":1515558,"title":"","content":"looking forward to it!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-19T16:16:55-07:00","id":1515579,"title":"","content":"If the Aegis Kickstarter doesn't start until July 6th or 13th, I'll be able to join in. Although I want the Ancient Greek setting, I hope there will be books for Egypt, Mesopotamia, Persia, India, China, and the Celts. Ancient mythology as Ancient Aliens territory is bad scholarship but great RPGing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/857-astromancer","name":"Astromancer","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar857_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2195"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-20T02:33:20-07:00","id":1515636,"title":"","content":"I'm happy to say we do go out of our way to not go the Ancient Aliens path (and also calling that out for the nonsense it is) while still bringing original cool Trinity twists that merge history &amp; myths with sci-fi in Aegis.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":38,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","user":"Cinder","date":". 06-20-2023, 05:59 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2023-06-20T06:57:24-07:00","id":1515658,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cinder</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/trinity/trinity-continuum-aegis/1514796-trinity-aegis-kickstarter?p=1515636#post1515636\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm happy to say we do go out of our way to not go the Ancient Aliens path (and also calling that out for the nonsense it is) while still bringing original cool Trinity twists that merge history &amp; myths with sci-fi in Aegis.</div> </div> </div> </div>When Carl Sagan first did Ancient Aliens it was a serious hypothesis. When Doctor Who, Star Trek, and Jack Kirby picked up on the idea it was goofy fun. Once <b>Chariots of the Gods </b>\u200b\u200bcame out it has been sleazy nasty ever since. I thought this was a return to Kirby, but if it skips Ancient Astronauts ( and the vile associations) altogether I'm happy.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{